00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:04.272
TO STUDIO C

00:01:04.355 --> 00:01:07.567
<i>Please ask any questions you may have</i> <i>through the live chat.</i>

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:13.073
<i>Everyone, let me remind you once more</i> <i>that we will not be selling the product</i>

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:15.033
<i>on tonight's broadcast.</i>

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:19.245
<i>Put down your phones for a moment,</i> <i>and please listen to my explanation.</i>

00:01:20.538 --> 00:01:24.209
<i>What surprised me the most</i> <i>as I learned about La Fin Essence</i>

00:01:24.292 --> 00:01:27.921
<i>was the raw material</i> <i>that makes up more than 90% of it.</i>

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.298
<i>This white flower noori mushroom</i>

00:01:30.381 --> 00:01:32.342
<i>is a species native only to Korea,</i>

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.553
<i>and it is cultivated exclusively</i> <i>in Deokpung Village.</i>

00:01:36.179 --> 00:01:39.098
<i>Even a slight change in temperature</i> <i>or humidity can make them spoil.</i>

00:01:39.182 --> 00:01:41.935
Did she just blow a prime-time slot worth millions per minute?

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:44.729
<i>So they're very delicate</i> <i>and require meticulous care.</i>

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:46.397
<i>To be honest, L'Étoile's La Fin Essence</i>

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:50.401
<i>is such a well-known product</i> <i>that needs no introduction from me.</i>

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:53.363
<i>We're getting a lot of questions</i> <i>about not being able to order.</i>

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:56.407
<i>Again, please note</i> <i>that we will not be selling the product</i>

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:58.076
<i>on tonight's broadcast.</i>

00:01:58.159 --> 00:02:00.829
Stop the broadcast now and switch to a prerecorded segment!

00:02:02.539 --> 00:02:04.374
We'd like to thank you

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.793
for taking the time to listen to our introduction

00:02:06.876 --> 00:02:09.587
of L'Étoile's La Fin Essence.

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:13.424
We'll be back with the next broadcast as soon as possible.

00:02:13.508 --> 00:02:15.093
This has been Dam Ye-jin.

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:17.220
HIT HOMESHOPPING

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.139
Dam Ye-jin, you rotten brat.

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:20.765
Have you lost your mind?

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:22.225
Are you taking responsibility?

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.269
